/* ===== Blossom Vow polish (user 2026-11-24: nav labels cut off; the ranking does not look scrollable; too many button
   styles; Reina blends into the background) ===== */
/* ranking: a framed board with a header, a visible scroll bar, a fade and a bouncing arrow while more rows are below,
